#: Settings.ui.h:1
msgid ""
"When set to minimize, double clicking minimizes all the windows of the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer stel om die minimum te beperk, dubbel te kliek verminder alle die "
"vensters van die aansoek."

#: Settings.ui.h:2
msgid "Shift+Click action"
msgstr "Shift + Klik aksie"

#: Settings.ui.h:3
msgid "Raise window"
msgstr "Verhoog Venster"

#: Settings.ui.h:4
msgid "Minimize window"
msgstr "Minimaliseer venster"

#: Settings.ui.h:5
msgid "Launch new instance"
msgstr "Loods nuwe instansie"

#: Settings.ui.h:6
msgid "Cycle through windows"
msgstr "Siklus deur vensters"

#: Settings.ui.h:7
msgid "Minimize or overview"
msgstr "Minimaliseer of oorsig"

#: Settings.ui.h:8
msgid "Show window previews"
msgstr "Wys venster voorskoue"

#: Settings.ui.h:9
msgid "Minimize or show previews"
msgstr "Minimaliseer of wys voorskoue"

#: Settings.ui.h:10
msgid "Focus or show previews"
msgstr "Fokus of wys voorskoue"

#: Settings.ui.h:12
msgid "Focus, minimize or show previews"
msgstr "Fokus, minimaliseer of wys voorskoue"

#: Settings.ui.h:14
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Quit"

#: Settings.ui.h:15
msgid "Behavior for Middle-Click."
msgstr "Gedrag vir- Midde-Klick."

#: Settings.ui.h:16
msgid "Middle-Click action"
msgstr "Midde-Klik aksie"

#: Settings.ui.h:17
msgid "Behavior for Shift+Middle-Click."
msgstr "Gedrag- vir Shift + Middel-Klik."

#: Settings.ui.h:18
msgid "Shift+Middle-Click action"
msgstr "Shift + Midde-Klick aksie"

#: Settings.ui.h:19
msgid "Enable Unity7 like glossy backlit items"
msgstr "Aktiveer Unity7 soos glansagtige items met agtergrondbeligting"

#: Settings.ui.h:20
msgid "Apply glossy effect."
msgstr "Toe te pas glans effek."

#: Settings.ui.h:21
msgid "Use dominant color"
msgstr "Gebruik dominante kleur"

#: Settings.ui.h:22
msgid "Customize indicator style"
msgstr "Customize aanwyser styl"

#: Settings.ui.h:23
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Kleur"

#: Settings.ui.h:24
msgid "Border color"
msgstr "Rand kleur"

#: Settings.ui.h:25
msgid "Border width"
msgstr "Grens wydte"

#: Settings.ui.h:26
msgid "Show the dock on"
msgstr "Wys die beskuldigdebank on"

#: Settings.ui.h:25
msgid "Show on all monitors."
msgstr "Wys op alle monitors."

#: Settings.ui.h:28
msgid "Position on screen"
msgstr "Posisie op skerm"

#: Settings.ui.h:30
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Bodem"

#: Settings.ui.h:31
msgid "Top"
msgstr "Bopunt"

#: Settings.ui.h:33
msgid ""
"Hide the dock when it obstructs a window of the current application. More "
"refined settings are available."
msgstr ""
"Steek die beskuldigdebank weg as dit 'n venster van die huidige toepassing "
"belemmer. Meer verfynde instellings is beskikbaar."

#: Settings.ui.h:34
msgid "Intelligent autohide"
msgstr "Intelligente outo-verberg"

#: Settings.ui.h:35
msgid "Dock size limit"
msgstr "Beskuldigdebank grootte limiet"

#: Settings.ui.h:36
msgid "Panel mode: extend to the screen edge"
msgstr "Paneel modus: strek tot by die skermrand"

#: Settings.ui.h:38
msgid "Icon size limit"
msgstr "Ikoon grootte limiet"

#: Settings.ui.h:39
msgid "Fixed icon size: scroll to reveal other icons"
msgstr "Vaste ikoon grootte: blaai om ander ikone te openbaar"

#: Settings.ui.h:40
msgid "Preview size scale"
msgstr "Voorskou grootte skaal"

#: Settings.ui.h:41
msgid "Position and size"
msgstr "Posisie en grootte"

#: prefs.js:242
msgid "Show favorite applications"
msgstr "Wys gunsteling toepassings"

#: Settings.ui.h:43
msgid "Show running applications"
msgstr "Wys hardloop aansoeke"

#: Settings.ui.h:41
msgid "Isolate workspaces."
msgstr "Isoleer werkruimtes."

#: Settings.ui.h:42
msgid "Show urgent windows despite current workspace."
msgstr "Wys dringende vensters ten spyte van huidige werkspasie."

#: Settings.ui.h:43
msgid "Isolate monitors."
msgstr "Isoleer monitors."

#: Settings.ui.h:44
msgid "Show open windows previews."
msgstr "Wys oop vensters voorskoue."

#: Settings.ui.h:48
msgid "Keep the focused application always visible in the dash"
msgstr "Hou die fokus aansoek altyd-sigbaar in die paneelbord"

#: Settings.ui.h:49
msgid ""
"If disabled, these settings are accessible from gnome-tweak-tool or the "
"extension website."
msgstr ""
"As dit gedeaktiveer is, is hierdie instellings toeganklik vanaf die gnome-"
"tweak-instrument of die webwerf vir uitbreidings."

#: Settings.ui.h:50
msgid "Show <i>Applications</i> icon"
msgstr "Wys <i>Applications</i> ikoon"

#: Settings.ui.h:48
msgid "Move the applications button at the beginning of the dock."
msgstr "Skuif die toepassings knoppie aan die begin van die beskuldigdebank."

#: Settings.ui.h:49
msgid "Animate <i>Show Applications</i>."
msgstr "Animate <i>Show Applications</i>."

#: Settings.ui.h:54
msgid "Show trash can"
msgstr "Wys asblik"

#: Settings.ui.h:55
msgid "Show volumes and devices"
msgstr "Wys volumes en toestelle"

#: Settings.ui.h:56
msgid "Only if mounted"
msgstr "Slegs indien gemonteer"

#: Settings.ui.h:57
msgid "Include network volumes"
msgstr "Sluit netwerk volumes in"

#: Settings.ui.h:58
msgid "Isolate volumes, devices and trash windows from file manager"
msgstr "Isoleer volumes, toestelle en asblik vensters vanaf lêer bestuurder"

#: Settings.ui.h:65
msgid "Launchers"
msgstr "Lanceerinrichtingen"

#: Settings.ui.h:66
msgid ""
"Enable Super+(0-9) as shortcuts to activate apps. It can also be used "
"together with Shift and Ctrl."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer Super+(0-9) as kortpaaie om programme te aktiveer. Dit kan ook saam "
"met Shift en Ctrl gebruik word."

#: Settings.ui.h:67
msgid "Use keyboard shortcuts to activate apps"
msgstr "Gebruik sleutelbord kortpaaie te aktiveer programme"

#: Settings.ui.h:68
msgid "Behaviour when clicking on the icon of a running application."
msgstr "Gedrag wanneer jy kliek op die ikoon van 'n lopende aansoek."

#: Settings.ui.h:69
msgid "Click action"
msgstr "Klik aksie"

#: Settings.ui.h:70
msgid "Minimize"
msgstr "Minimaliseer"

#: Settings.ui.h:71
msgid "Behaviour when scrolling on the icon of an application."
msgstr "Gedrag wanneer blaai op die ikoon- van 'n aansoek."

#: Settings.ui.h:72
msgid "Scroll action"
msgstr "Boekrol aksie"

#: Settings.ui.h:73
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "Doen niks"

#: Settings.ui.h:74
msgid "Switch workspace"
msgstr "Skakel -werkspasie"

#: Settings.ui.h:75
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Gedrag"

#: Settings.ui.h:80
msgid ""
"Few customizations meant to integrate the dock with the default GNOME theme. "
"Alternatively, specific options can be enabled below."
msgstr ""
"Few customizations bedoel om integreer die beskuldigdebank met die verstek "
"GNOME tema. Alternatiewelik kan spesifieke opsies hieronder aangeskakel word."

#: Settings.ui.h:81
msgid "Use built-in theme"
msgstr "Gebruik ingeboude tema"

#: Settings.ui.h:76
msgid "Save space reducing padding and border radius."
msgstr "Bespaar ruimte en verminder padding en grens radius."

#: Settings.ui.h:77
msgid "Shrink the dash"
msgstr "Krimp die aandagstreep"

#: Settings.ui.h:82
msgid "Customize windows counter indicators"
msgstr "Customize vensters se toonbankaanwysers aan"

