#: Settings.ui.h:98
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Ondeursigtigheid"

#: Settings.ui.h:78
msgid "Force straight corner"
msgstr "Dwing reguit hoek."

#: Settings.ui.h:79
msgid "Show overview on startup"
