#: Settings.ui.h:110
msgid "Number overlay"
msgstr "Aantal oortrek"

#: Settings.ui.h:111
msgid ""
"Temporarily show the application numbers over the icons, corresponding to "
"the shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Wys die toepassings nommers tydelik oor die ikone, wat ooreenstem met die "
"kortpad."

#: Settings.ui.h:112
msgid "Show the dock if it is hidden"
msgstr "Wys die beskuldigdebank as dit versteek is"

#: Settings.ui.h:113
msgid ""
"If using autohide, the dock will appear for a short time when triggering the "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"As die gebruik van auto-verberg, sal die beskuldigdebank verskyn vir 'n kort "
"tyd wanneer triggering die kortpad."

#: Settings.ui.h:114
msgid "Shortcut for the options above"
msgstr "Kortpad vir die opsies hierbo"

#: Settings.ui.h:115
msgid "Syntax: <Shift>, <Ctrl>, <Alt>, <Super>"
msgstr "Sintaks: <Shift>, <Ctrl>, <Alt>, <Super>"

#: Settings.ui.h:116
msgid "Hide timeout (s)"
msgstr "Verberg tyduit (s)"

#: Settings.ui.h:117
msgid "Show the dock by mouse hover on the screen edge."
msgstr "Wys die beskuldigdebank met 'n muis hover oor die skerm rand."

#: Settings.ui.h:118
msgid "Autohide"
msgstr "Outo-verberg"

#: Settings.ui.h:119
msgid "Push to show: require pressure to show the dock"
msgstr "Stoot om wys: vereis druk om die beskuldigdebank te wys"

#: Settings.ui.h:120
msgid "Enable in fullscreen mode"
msgstr "Instaat stel in volskerm modus"

#: Settings.ui.h:122
msgid "Show the dock when it doesn't obstruct application windows."
msgstr ""
"Wys die beskuldigdebank wanneer dit nie aansoek vensters nie belemmer."

